<a class=\"nav-tag\" href=\"#faq\">常见问题答疑</a>\n    </nav>\n  </header>\n\n  <section id=\"plans\" class=\"section-block\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <h2>服务方案档位</h2>\n      <p>按周期结算。根据终端数量与流量需求选择。</p>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"plan-stack\">\n      <article class=\"plan-card\">\n        <div class=\"plan-top\">\n          <div>\n            <h3 class=\"plan-name\">基础版</h3>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"plan-prices\">\n            <span class=\"plan-price-monthly\">¥15/月</span>\n            <span class=\"plan-price-annual\">按年付仅需 ¥150/年</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <ul class=\"feature-list\">\n          <li>每月 100GB 极速流量</li>\n          <li>支持 3 台设备同时在线</li>\n          <li>解锁基础流媒体</li>\n          <li>普通线路节点池</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn-select\">选用基础规格</a>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"plan-card highlight\">\n        <span class=\"plan-badge\">推荐档位</span>\n        <div class=\"plan-top\">\n          <div>\n            <h3 class=\"plan-name\">旗舰版</h3>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"plan-prices\">\n            <span class=\"plan-price-monthly\">¥35/月</span>\n            <span class=\"plan-price-annual\">按年付仅需 ¥350/年</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <ul class=\"feature-list\">\n          <li>每月 300GB 极速流量</li>\n          <li>支持 5 台设备同时在线</li>\n          <li>全节点原生流媒体解锁</li>\n          <li>IPLC 专线游戏加速优化</li>\n          <li>7x24 优先工单支持</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn-select\">选用旗舰规格</a>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"plan-card\">\n        <div class=\"plan-top\">\n          <div>\n            <h3 class=\"plan-name\">团队版</h3>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"plan-prices\">\n            <span class=\"plan-price-monthly\">¥85/月</span>\n            <span class=\"plan-price-annual\">按年付仅需 ¥850/年</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <ul class=\"feature-list\">\n          <li>每月 1000GB 极速流量</li>\n          <li>支持 20 台设备同时在线</li>\n          <li>VIP 专属高带宽节点</li>\n          <li>支持企业定制路由</li>\n          <li>专属客户经理服务</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn-select\">选用团队规格</a>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section id=\"setup\" class=\"section-block\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <h2>接入与客户端指引</h2>\n      <p>四步完成部署。核心在于准确获取并更新订阅链接。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"setup-grid\">\n      <div class=\"setup-card\">\n        <h3>通用配置步骤</h3>\n        <ol>\n          <li>进入用户中心复制专属订阅 URL。</li>\n          <li>在受支持的通用代理客户端中添加订阅配置。</li>\n          <li>点击更新节点列表，选择就近路由。</li>\n          <li>开启规则分流模式，按需分配本地流量。</li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"client-info-box\">\n        <p><strong>适配说明：</strong>系统支持标准订阅格式。可在 Windows、macOS、iOS、Android 以及各类支持标准核心的路由系统上协同运作。</p>\n        <p>第三方客户端请前往其对应开源社区或官方发布页下载。本平台提供标准化配置接口。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section id=\"faq\" class=\"section-block\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <h2>常见问题解答</h2>\n      <p>关于流量周期、节点分流与协议适配的具体说明。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-stack\">\n      <details class=\"faq-item\">\n        <summary>每月流量如何计算重置？</summary>\n        <p>流量按自然周期计算。每月在账单订购日重置配额。当月未用尽额度不结转至下一周期。</p>\n      </details>\n\n      <details class=\"faq-item\">\n        <summary>超过同时在线设备限制会怎样？</summary>\n        <p>超出限定数量的新设备发起握手时将被阻断。请关闭非活跃终端的连接以释放通道。</p>\n      </details>\n\n      <details class=\"faq-item\">\n        <summary>遇到节点延迟高或无法同步如何排查？</summary>\n        <p>先在客户端内执行订阅强制同步。若本地 DNS 被污染，可在软件内切换公共 DoH 节点后再做测试。</p>\n      </details>\n\n      <details class=\"faq-item\">\n        <summary>是否可以中途更换更高规格套餐？</summary>\n        <p>支持差额补齐升级。新规格的并发设备数与流量上限将在付款后即刻更新生效。</p>\n      </details>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <footer>\n    <div>© 青丝(qingsiyun) · 静态说明文档归档</div>\n    <div>\n      <a href=\"#plans\">返回套餐</a> · \n      <a href=\"#setup\">配置指引</a> · \n      <a href=\"#faq\">常见问题</a>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n</main>",
